  "description": "One cold winter, Se-Ra, who had just experienced her first breakup, is introduced to a man named Kae-Se by a friend. However, they experience many twists and turns, and a great deal of trouble! Will these two be able to make it safely across the finish line? \n\n(Source: Manhwakyung, translated) \n\n*Notes:\n\\- Chapter count includes a prologue\n\\- The title is a play on words: it can be translated as \"Kae-Se and Se-Ra\" (the character's names), or it can refer to the well-known phrase \"que sera, sera\", meaning \"whatever will be, will be\".*",
